# Branches

`main` is production. Vercel production deploys from `main` only.

- Do not commit, push, or merge directly to `main`.
- Create `feature/<short-name>` from an up-to-date `main`.
- Open a pull request into `main` for review.
- Do not force-push `main`.

```bash
git checkout main
git pull
git checkout -b feature/short-name
```

The full brief is `AGENTS.md`. Do not fill in the Solution section unless the team has chosen the task there.
